      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Miscellaneous-tax money: 1,151 ryō 2 bu in gold, plus (ト) a silver remainder of 2 monme 7 bu 6 rin 2 mō 6 futsu. Parsed as 1,151.5 ryō for the gold portion, following MASTER (2 bu = half a ryō). The scan prints the silver tail out to 二毛六弗; the MASTER raw string stops at 二毛, so this box carries two printed glyphs MASTER does not record."
      },
      {
