    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "鯣十萬枚"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "鯣　十万枚／するめ 100,000まい"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Miscellaneous-tax dried squid (surume): 100,000 sheets. MASTER records this field as 鍋 (pot), but the scan reads 鯣: at single-character zoom the left radical is 魚 (hooked ⺈ top, boxy body, compressed 灬 base — not the triangular kanehen roof) and the right side is 易 (日 over the hooked diagonals of 勿), confirmed against the large-type 鍋 of the ○高鍋藩 marker on upper p127 right, whose 咼 with solid closing 口 looks entirely different. Dried squid counted in 枚 also fits a Sea-of-Japan coastal domain, and 鯣 is attested elsewhere in HI product/tax lists (館藩 鯣類・鯣粕, 高鍋藩 鯣魚)."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "鯣"
      }
    ],
